# ── Refresh ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Fetches the online fixings of the trade (GET /trades/{id}/fixings/online), which stores them on the trade; the
# outcome is read on the trade retrieved afterwards.
@When "^maker refreshes the online fixings of the trade$"
    When get '/trades/{id}/fixings/online' with path parameter 'id' from stored variable 'createdTradeId' as user 'maker'
    And attach the response body to the report
    Then response status code is '200'

# ── Assertions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# On the trade just retrieved. After a refresh: 'every schedule date before today has a fixing value' (Java,
# TradeApiSteps), the schedule's fixing dates read from checkData.fixingDates of the case data.
@Then "^the queried trade contains empty fixing data$"
    Then response status code is '200'
    And response body contains a key 'data.fixings' as '{}'
